5555: # (D3, F03-2, F04-4) The coordinator's identity, resolved ONCE at the start of a run (a panel member
5556: # and a detached background take their run's - never inferred again downstream): the value of
5557: # CODEX_CONSULT_COORDINATOR (optional) parsed by the reviewer matcher (ConvertFrom-ReviewerMatcher)
5558: # - `<provider> :: <model>` [` [<engine>]`], a roster position `#<n>` (resolved to that entry's
5559: # provider, model and engine) or a provider label - and the host inferred from the markers (a hint:
5560: # no warning comes from it). A value that does not parse, a position the roster does not have, a
5561: # provider that is not a label (letters, digits, dot, dash, underscore) or a model with white space
5562: # is refused (Error). { Record - the ledger's `coordinator` {provider, model, engine, host, source:
5563: # explicit | inferred | none}; Error ('' or the refusal) }.
